<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Noven said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Noven said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut Noven Pharmaceuticals Inc to outperform from buy, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 2-15/16 to 8-1/16.</p>
</text>
